  "stateNote": "Grind the chicken, green pepper, cilantro, culantro, garlic, and onion with the grinder attachment of a mixer or a food processor. Add adobo seasoning to taste. In a large nonstick skillet, cook the meat mixture until it is lightly browned. Add the tomato paste and tomato sauce and salt and pepper to taste. Cook about 2 minutes longer and shut off the heat. Let the meat rest while you continue on.",
